            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 40,
              "start": 40
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Breyer further asked whether a defendant can lack standing and requested recommendations on the topic."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "5f5a0eb0504cc6c066057b59a1d2471d34978fc57ecfcd47c9f86b7594105769",
